[00:00.00] 作词 : Morgan Wallen/John Byron/Blake Pendergrass/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:00.00][by:波罗猫与海鸥心]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/John Byron/Blake Pendergrass/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:12.76]When the tears get to fallin', do you miss my shoulder?
[00:12.76]当泪水滑落时 你是否怀念我的肩膀
[00:19.00]When the nights get cold, do you still reach over?
[00:19.00]当寒夜降临时 你是否仍习惯性伸手
[00:25.17]Do you dodge everywhere, everything that reminds you
[00:25.17]你是否会逃避一切 所有让你想起我的事物
[00:31.20]Or do you point your wheels down memory lane like I do?
[00:31.20]还是会像我一样 驾车驶向回忆的小径
[00:37.55]When you’re crawling into bed with the guy you chose
[00:37.55]当你与新选的伴侣相拥入眠
[00:40.90]Instead of spending Saturday night alone
[00:40.90]不再独自度过周六夜晚
[00:44.05]Tell me, am I still where your mind'll go?
[00:44.05]告诉我 我的身影是否仍会浮现在你心间
[00:47.20]Who do you see when your eyes are closed?
[00:47.20]当你闭上双眼 看见的是谁的脸
[00:50.15]'Cause baby, I can tell ya, it's you for me
[00:50.15]宝贝 我想告诉你 我眼中始终只有你
[00:53.40]No one else can do the things you do for me
[00:53.40]再无人能像你一样 给予我这般心悸
[00:56.19]Can you feel me in the air, baby, like a ghost?
[00:56.19]你能否感知我如幽灵般 在空气中徘徊不去
[00:59.60]Who do you see when your eyes are closed?
[00:59.60]当你闭上双眼 看见的是谁的身影
[01:08.58]Do you dream on back to our up all nighters?
[01:08.58]你是否会梦回那些彻夜长谈的时光
[01:14.72]When my smart-ass mouth made the world feel lighter
[01:14.72]我曾用俏皮话语 让世界都变得明亮
[01:21.00]When you said we were done, did you really mean maybe?
[01:21.00]当你说我们结束时 是否还有一线希望尚存
[01:27.12]Or am I the only one, am I just plain crazy, baby?
[01:27.12]还是说只有我如此疯狂 仍旧困在原地
[01:33.25]When you’re crawling into bed with the guy you chose
[01:33.25]当你与新选的伴侣相拥入眠
[01:36.60]Instead of spending Saturday night alone
[01:36.60]不再独自度过周六夜晚
[01:39.90]Tell me, am I still where your mind'll go?
[01:39.90]告诉我 我的名字是否仍会跃入你思绪
[01:42.90]Who do you see when your eyes are closed?
[01:42.90]当你闭上双眼 浮现的是谁的轮廓
[01:45.86]'Cause baby, I can tell ya, it's you for me
[01:45.86]宝贝 我想告诉你 我心中始终只有你
[01:49.16]No one else can do the things you do for me
[01:49.16]再无人能像你一样 占据我所有情绪
[01:51.89]Can you feel me in the air, baby, like a ghost?
[01:51.89]你能否感受到我如幻影般 在回忆里穿梭不息
[01:55.35]Who do you see when your eyes are closed?
[01:55.35]当你闭上双眼 看见的是谁的笑容
[02:01.58]Who do you see when your eyes are closed?
[02:01.58]当你闭上双眼 看见的是谁的身影
[02:04.85]‘Cause I can't get you outta my brain these days
[02:04.85]如今我无法将你从脑海抹去
[02:09.35]Even for a night
[02:09.35]哪怕只一晚也不行
[02:11.19]I can feel you here, can you feel me there?
[02:11.19]我能感知你在此处 你能否感应我的彼方
[02:14.20]Now and then, or every time?
[02:14.20]是偶尔想起 还是每分每秒
